# Public-dataset recordings: only replayable alongside the source archives,
# which are not committed. See eval/datasets/README.md. Exception: the
# committed holdout recording replays against the committed holdout databases.
eval/recordings/public-*.jsonl
!eval/recordings/public-ornith-r3-holdout.jsonl

# Stage-4b real-vendor holdout: per-draw recordings and per-draw result files
